901
00:47:19,086 --> 00:47:22,506
Lalu kita akan paksa Lily memberitahu kita,
di mana Jesse berada.

902
00:47:29,012 --> 00:47:30,722
Oh, akhirnya.

903
00:47:35,853 --> 00:47:37,521
