Sahabat sekalian, kita berkumpul hari ini

1632
01:27:53,851 --> 01:27:57,105
untuk menyaksikan perpaduan terindah antara

1633
01:27:57,146 --> 01:27:58,523
Sheriff Jessie

1634
01:27:58,564 --> 01:28:01,276
dan Buzz-tholomew
MacLightyear.

1635
01:28:09,367 --> 01:28:11,119
Sekarang, Sheriff,

1636
01:28:11,160 --> 01:28:14,497
silahkan pasangkan cincin ini ke jarinya Buzz yang sangat kecil

1637
01:28:14,539 --> 01:28:16,374
dan ucapkan sumpahmu.

1638
01:28:17,834 --> 01:28:20,378
Buzz, bersediakah kau menerima cincin ini

1639
01:28:20,420 --> 01:28:22,088
sebagai janjiku

1640
01:28:22,130 --> 01:28:25,133
untuk bersenang-senang, dan bermain denganmu,
dan lain-lain

1641
01:28:25,174 --> 01:28:27,093
di semua hari-hariku,

1642
01:28:27,135 --> 01:28:29,137
bahkan di hari yang sulit sekalipun?

1643
01:28:29,178 --> 01:28:31,764
- Aku bersedia.
- Bonnie...

1644
01:28:31,806 --> 01:28:33,308
Apa kau melihat cincin pernikahanku?

1645
01:28:34,475 --> 01:28:35,601
Uh...

1646
01:28:35,643 --> 01:28:37,645
mungkin periksa di kamar mandi?

1647
01:28:37,687 --> 01:28:38,980
Tunggu, bentar, kita butuh..

1648
01:28:39,022 --> 01:28:40,231
Bunga! Bunga dari taman.

1649
01:28:40,273 --> 01:28:42,317
- Ide yang bagus.
- Ikuti aku.

1650
01:28:42,358 --> 01:28:44,485
Dan ada konfeti di laci peralatan.

1651
01:28:45,570 --> 01:28:47,030
Oh, selamat! Kalian berdua.

1652
01:28:47,071 --> 01:28:48,448
Tenang saja.
Aku memotret banyak foto

1653
01:28:48,489 --> 01:28:49,907
untuk Smarty dan gengnya.

1654
01:28:49,949 --> 01:28:52,368
Kamu baik sekali, Lily.

1655
01:28:53,995 --> 01:28:54,912
Mmm.

1656
01:28:55,580 --> 01:28:57,040
Kamu sudah berupaya dengan baik, Sheriff.

1657
01:28:57,790 --> 01:28:59,625
Kamu boleh memanggilku Jessica.

1658
01:29:00,251 --> 01:29:01,878
Oke, pasti. Jessica.

1659
01:29:02,587 --> 01:29:04,088
Sebenarnya tidak. Tidak.

1660
01:29:04,130 --> 01:29:05,173
Ok.

1661
01:29:06,382 --> 01:29:07,842
Hei, bila sempat,

1662
01:29:07,884 --> 01:29:10,136
bisakah kau kenalkan aku dengan pembawa cincin?

1663
01:29:10,178 --> 01:29:11,804
-Oh.
-Awooga.

1664
01:29:11,846 --> 01:29:12,930
Ok.

1665
01:29:12,972 --> 01:29:14,098
Mereka akan datang.

1666
01:29:14,974 --> 01:29:16,392
Sudah dapat. Bagus.

1667
01:29:16,434 --> 01:29:17,852
Itu ide bagus.

1668
01:29:17,894 --> 01:29:19,687
Pernikahannya dilanjutkan.

1669
01:29:19,729 --> 01:29:20,772
Ok!

1670
01:29:20,813 --> 01:29:22,357
- Buzz...
- Buzz,

1671
01:29:22,398 --> 01:29:25,234
bersediakah kau menerimaku sebagai istri Sheriff-mu yang hebat?

1672
01:29:25,276 --> 01:29:26,652
Aku bersedia.

1673
01:29:26,694 --> 01:29:28,112
Dan bersediakah kau menerimaku sebagai suamimu,

1674
01:29:28,154 --> 01:29:30,406
Ranger Angkasa yang ganteng ini?

1675
01:29:30,907 --> 01:29:32,492
Oh.

1676
01:29:33,201 --> 01:29:34,452
Aku bersedia.

1677
01:29:35,161 --> 01:29:37,246
Dan sekarang kunyatakan kalian...

1678
01:29:37,288 --> 01:29:39,165
Aku keberatan!

1679
01:29:39,207 --> 01:29:40,124
Oh, tidak.

1680
01:29:40,917 --> 01:29:42,960
Buzz sudah menikah...

1681
01:29:43,044 --> 01:29:44,087
denganku!

1682
01:29:47,757 --> 01:29:51,135
Ini ketiga kalinya terjadi padaku!

1683
01:29:51,177 --> 01:29:52,595
Teganya kau?

1684
01:29:52,637 --> 01:29:54,055
PLAK!

1685
01:29:54,097 --> 01:29:56,349
Jessie,
ini bukan seperti yang kamu pikirkan.

1686
01:29:56,391 --> 01:29:59,227
Cerita ke mereka, Buzz!
Ceritakan tentang cinta kita!

1687
01:29:59,268 --> 01:30:01,229
Tapi Trixie, itu dulu...

1688
01:30:01,270 --> 01:30:03,773
dan ini sekarang.

1689
01:30:04,482 --> 01:30:06,067
Jaga bayi-bayi itu!

1690
01:30:06,109 --> 01:30:07,402
Kau akan dengar dari pengacaraku tentang ini!

1691
01:30:07,443 --> 01:30:08,861
Ini keterlaluan.
Katakan ke mereka, Buzz.

1692
01:30:08,903 --> 01:30:11,572
- SELAMAT.
- Kau pasti bisa, Deputi.

1693
01:30:12,657 --> 01:30:14,242
- Jadi, apa kau membantu?
-Ya.

1694
01:30:14,283 --> 01:30:16,244
Kami hanya mengikuti arahan Jessie.

1695
01:30:16,285 --> 01:30:18,329
- Woody, bersediakah kau...
-Um...

1696
01:30:18,371 --> 01:30:20,832
- ...memegangkan ini? Aku yang nyetir.
- Ya

1697
01:30:21,874 --> 01:30:23,000
Ooh, la la.

1698
01:30:26,963 --> 01:30:29,090
Ya! Lihatlah mereka.
Mereka gembira sekali.

1699
01:30:29,132 --> 01:30:30,550
Mereka berteman baik.

1700
01:30:30,591 --> 01:30:31,926
Oke, simpan yang itu.

1701
01:30:31,968 --> 01:30:33,302
Galaknya.
Ya ampun. Ya!

1702
01:30:33,344 --> 01:30:34,762
Oke. Buzz pakai rok kilt.

1703
01:30:34,804 --> 01:30:36,431
Aku akan pindah ke Palm Springs.

1704
01:30:36,472 --> 01:30:38,099
Bagaimana kalau Trixie meracuni kue pernikahan?

1705
01:30:38,141 --> 01:30:42,186
Tapi, Trixie, kenapa?

1706
01:30:42,228 --> 01:30:44,605
Hei, apa kau mau menginap di rumahku?

1707
01:30:44,647 --> 01:30:47,358
Ya, itu pasti sangat menyenangkan.

1708
01:30:47,984 --> 01:30:49,110
Lihat. Lihat sini.

1709
01:30:51,237 --> 01:30:53,406
Teman selamanya, partner.

1710
01:30:53,448 --> 01:30:56,576
Ayo, Jessie.
Kita naik pesawat angkasaku.

1711
01:30:56,617 --> 01:30:58,619
Kita kemana dulu?
-Neptunus!

1712
01:30:58,661 --> 01:30:59,829
Kalian mau apa?

1713
01:30:59,871 --> 01:31:01,330
Berbulan madu!

1714
01:31:01,372 --> 01:31:02,415
Mau ikut?

1715
01:31:02,457 --> 01:31:05,001
- Ya tentu!
- Tunggu, tunggu.

1716
01:31:05,042 --> 01:31:06,502
Lihat, Jessica, ikan lumba-lumba angkasa!

1717
01:31:06,544 --> 01:31:07,587
Hi, lumba-lumba.

1730
01:32:03,184 --> 01:32:05,686
Penerjemah: Om Jangkung.

1777
01:34:26,661 --> 01:34:27,703
Whoa!

1778
01:34:35,670 --> 01:34:36,837
Huh?

1779
01:34:45,137 --> 01:34:46,555
Aku Buzz Lightyear.

1780
01:34:46,597 --> 01:34:48,599
Menuju Tak Terbatas dan Melampauinya!

1781
01:35:02,655 --> 01:35:04,699
Hei, kalian jangan nakal! Aku...

1782
01:35:04,740 --> 01:35:05,783
Oh.

1783
01:35:10,329 --> 01:35:11,580
Misi selesai.

1784
01:35:16,168 --> 01:35:18,587
Kita bertemu lagi, putraku.

1785
01:35:18,629 --> 01:35:20,214
Tidak!

1786
01:40:11,547 --> 01:40:14,008
Entah bagaimana melakukan ini.
Mainkan lagunya.

1801
01:40:37,948 --> 01:40:38,699
Ini butuh melodi.

1802
01:40:38,741 --> 01:40:39,867
Hentikan.

1803
01:40:39,908 --> 01:40:41,201
Pizza berkacamata, sayang.

1804
01:40:41,243 --> 01:40:42,953
Aku bukan kursi!